Description: VoidOS markdown editor for .vdoc documents
 A small, dependency-light GTK3 markdown editor with a live
 preview pane, built for VoidOS's native .vdoc document format
 (plain markdown text under the hood). Styled as a Word 2026-style
 ribbon: quick-access strip, tabbed ribbon with captioned command
 groups, and the document rendered as a white page on a gray canvas.
 All six ribbon tabs (File/Home/Insert/Layout/Review/View) are
 fully wired to working commands.

